From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ORYZON patch consolidation <noreply@example.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add DSSAT rice runner and experiment management presets

Consolidates the previously prepared DSSAT runner/FileX changes and experiment
preset API/UI changes into one patch. The DSSAT installation script is omitted.

IMPORTANT SCOPE:
- The included DssatRunner remains rice-only; it explicitly rejects non-rice
  seasons. The six uploaded MZ/SB/TM/CB/SC/PT FileX files are not wired into
  model-specific execution by this patch.
- This is therefore a consolidated baseline patch, NOT the requested completed
  six-crop DSSAT implementation. Do not treat non-rice crops as supported or
  calibrated based on this patch.

---
